priv->params.lro_timeout =
    mlx5e_choose_lro_timeout(mdev, MLX5E_DEFAULT_LRO_TIMEOUT);
```
Reason:
The patch introduces a new function `mlx5e_choose_lro_timeout` that dynamically selects the nearest supported LRO timeout value based on the actual hardware capabilities, ensuring that the timeout used is optimal and supported, thus fixing the bug.


